<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">Hello {!Lead.LastName},<u></u><u></u></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">I hope you're doing well.</p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">My name is {!User.FirstName}&nbsp;{!User.LastName}&nbsp;from One Algorithm LLC. We are a Woman-Owned Small Business providing cloud modernization, AI solutions, cybersecurity, Salesforce services, IT staffing, and program support for federal agencies.<u></u><u></u></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">We are interested in partnering with prime contractors as a subcontractor or teaming partner on federal opportunities. Our capabilities statement is attached for your review.<u></u><u></u></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">If your team is looking for qualified small business partners to support contract requirements and small business participation goals, I would welcome a brief conversation.<u></u><u></u></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">Thank you for your time, and I look forward to connecting.<u></u><u></u></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Best regards,<br><br><br><u></u><u></u></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><u></u>&nbsp;<u></u></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><u></u>&nbsp;<u></u></p><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: black;"><img width="1" height="1" id="m_5435478381080285661m_1551520051286142448_x0000_i1027" src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/meips/ADKq_Nbu0wilBXayb0dzR3oN37KfVYIZuqg5YG6ez3beJiEgm-lT38JwGSPG5YoOCQVwynzcfafBgNzygAdvxTu2Ns7K=s0-d-e1-ft#https://px.blinq.me/t/zqsZR-ikn5x8OpXi_-bRs" class="CToWUd" data-bit="iit" style="width: 0.0083in; height: 0.0083in;"></span><u></u><u></u></p><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tbody><tr><td style="margin: 0px; padding: 0in;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: white;">.</span><span style="color: white;"><u></u><u></u></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="margin: 0px; padding: 0in;"><table border="0" cellspacing="3" cellpadding="0"><tbody><tr><td style="margin: 0px; padding: 0.75pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0px;"><a href="https://blinq.me/8Noa8GlVOwJr" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://blinq.me/8Noa8GlVOwJr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1780423206261000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2rWlFikmB3eoJphZVxEuHS" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><span style="color: blue; text-decoration: none;"><img border="0" width="540" height="233" id="m_5435478381080285661m_1551520051286142448_x0000_i1026" src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/meips/ADKq_NZcOlbuNPyfpsc2kFlutSAhNYRVe2Zj_etUzYMK_SpMhdFLUywF_LihKMwn-uFDIp2kQ5n0xS2NBkbSsK5svb94ki_zAkjExUEhqZay6h-Bud3vvdOTglbs=s0-d-e1-ft#https://es.blinq.me/s4g7BzByG27yorhUUMDx0MgfoOs8IygB?c=mHDRhebyQbgi" class="CToWUd" data-bit="iit" style="width: 5.625in; height: 2.425in;"></span></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></td>
</tr>
